cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Tychon quantum sensing: an agent-orchestrated NV-magnetometer build"
abstract: >-
  Software for NV-diamond quantum magnetometers built with coding agents:
  a physics simulator, INT8 edge machine learning, PID plus neural-network
  control on a PolarFire SoC FPGA, a field-vector tracker, a demo dashboard,
  and a workbench that checks written claims with local language-model critics.
authors:
  - family-names: Phillip
    given-names: Jason
    website: "https://tychonai.com/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jasonphillip/tychon-quantum-sensing"
keywords:
  - quantum sensing
  - NV diamond
  - ODMR
  - magnetometry
  - FPGA
  - PolarFire SoC
  - edge machine learning
  - AI agents
